edit board files directly.\n\n## Story Workspace\n\nYou are running in an isolated Git worktree for STORY-260830-ptxkqe.\n\n- Workspace path: `.temp/STORY-260830-ptxkqe/worktree` (this is your working directory)\n- Branch: `task-board/story/STORY-260830-ptxkqe`, forked from `main`\n- Authoritative board: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board` (already exported as `TASK_BOARD_DIR`)\n\nMake every repository change here. Do not commit, switch, rebase, merge, or delete this branch, and do not run `task-board` against the `.task-board` copy inside this worktree — it is a checkout artifact, not the board. Integration into trunk is the orchestrator's step, not yours.\n\nLeave your work UNCOMMITTED in the worktree — the handoff snapshots the working tree against the recorded checkpoint. A commit of your own on this branch is refused at handoff with `change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint`, and the repair is `git reset --soft <checkpoint_oid>` before completing again.\n"}}
